{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Italian company is here, and the air in the opera house is thick with perfumes and tobacco. We took our seats near the stage, thanks to the Kleins who extended their stay just to sit with us. Lablache’s Figaro is a marvel of agility, though Dardanelli’s Countess sings with a sweetness that makes one forget her lack of power. Donzelli is adequate. The music is still the same, but the execution is sharper.\n\nWe dined at the Hofkeller. The wine was cold and the bread stale, but the company was good. I paid a small fortune for the ticket, which I regret, but I am glad I came.\n\nKarl writes that his health is improving; I hope he is not overworking his eyes. The heat here is oppressive. I am tired.\n\nYour loving husband,\n\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219340,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":187,"prompt_tokens":1113,"total_tokens":1300,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-xOxFaTwlvMDh8kbqw6A9GFFqKjdNbRVW","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1113,"prompt_ms":1061.954,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.954136567834681,"prompt_per_second":1048.0679954122306,"predicted_n":187,"predicted_ms":4349.257,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.38310215053763,"predicted_per_second":42.765925306322444}}